Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 21:14:29 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] yuzu: HD Rumble settings dialog for RenHDrum

Settings for the Switch controller HD Rumble (wired and Bluetooth) and the
DualSense haptics, opened from the Vibration dialog. The SDL driver reads
them on every vibration and re-applies on change.

Feito com Claude Code
